00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:54,137
Would you please just say
what you came here to say?

262
00:16:54,220 --> 00:16:55,240
Right, sorry.

263
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:58,137
There's been some movement
over at the Navy tent.

264
00:16:58,220 --> 00:17:00,161
I think they might come this way.

265
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:05,000
Vice Admiral Zuru's with them, and
the old Fleet Admiral Sengoku too.

266
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:07,360
Saru and Sengoku?

267
00:17:07,620 --> 00:17:10,297
Why'd they sit in a couple
of big guns like them?

268
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:11,210
Oh no!

269
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:12,870
Sengoku.

270
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,137
Leo, why were you calling me?

271
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:18,540
Oh, the Navy's getting
ready to attack you!

272
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:25,160
So, it's a six, then.

273
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,480
This is Providence.

274
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:29,780
All troops, advance.

275
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:33,440
Find the Straw Hats and
Law, and then capture them.

276
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:37,140
Also, arrest every criminal
that's within the palace.

277
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,106
Let's bring all of them down!

278
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:50,040
Admiral, we can't invade.
You need clearance.

279
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:52,281
You do your job and I'll do mine.

280
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:54,425
I'll take full responsibility.

281
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,550
Roger.

282
00:18:24,900 --> 00:18:26,237
They're on their way now.

283
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,791
We need to prepare quick.

284
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:30,820
Our luck has run out!

285
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:32,937
There's nothing left to prepare.

286
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:35,257
We ensured we were ready
to escape days ago.

287
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:37,693
We were waiting for Sir Luffy to awaken.

288
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:40,240
Yes, though it worked in our favor,

289
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,617
I must admit it was strange that
they didn't come for us earlier.

290
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:45,137
There's just one problem.

291
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:47,000
We are in need of a vessel.

292
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:48,414
That means we're dead!

293
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:51,357
We're not getting anywhere without a ship!

294
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,381
Hey, Leo, have you carried
out the request I made?

295
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,577
Yes, of course, sir.

296
00:18:56,660 --> 00:18:58,917
I followed your
instructions to the letter.

297
00:18:59,000 --> 00:18:59,830
Keep your distance.

298
00:18:59,913 --> 00:19:00,940
It's too dangerous.

299
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:03,865
We're here to capture pirates.

300
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,276
Stay out of the way!

301
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:08,120
No, they'll get Lucy.

302
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:09,650
Uh-oh.

303
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:12,897
Some of the Marines are
heading up to the palace, too.

304
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:15,039
All of the fighters will need help.

305
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,620
Ah, thanks for your concern, little pal.

306
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:19,080
But don't worry,

307
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:22,317
we've been keeping an eye out for
the Navy ourselves this whole time.

308
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,500
Time to get going.

309
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:25,380
I'll lead the way.

310
00:19:25,980 --> 00:19:28,937
We're gonna make a beeline
for the port in the east.

311
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:32,497
We knew you'd be ready to skip town
as soon as everybody was awake.

312
00:19:32,580 --> 00:19:35,933
So our people are set up in
strategic places to help you.

313
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:38,493
They've been on standby for a while now.

314
00:19:38,900 --> 00:19:40,900
They'll clear a path for you easy.

315
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:46,422
Plus, there's a ship
waiting at the eastern port.

316
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:48,832
Man, you're a lifesaver.

317
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:53,364
We let Nami's group take the Sunny,
so we were in kind of a bind.

318
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:55,700
Anything for yous guys.

319
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,740
We all fought together as a team.

320
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:05,239
You think we'd just roll over and
let them take our star player away?

321
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,380
Bellamy, can you walk?

322
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,710
Yeah.

323
00:20:14,793 --> 00:20:18,120
Or run if I need to.
All right. Good to hear.

324
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:24,260
Trafalgar, why didn't you
leave me to my fate back there?

325
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:27,420
Thanks to you, I lost my place to die.

326
00:20:28,020 --> 00:20:31,726
Straw Hat said that you were a
friend of his, so I carried you.

327
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:33,440
Die here if you want.

328
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:38,337
Now that those tiny people have patched
me up, it's like I was never injured.

329
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:42,137
So what makes you think I'm gonna be
killed off by a run-in with the damn Navy?

330
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:44,700
And find another way to die, dumbass.

331
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,860
What'd you say?

332
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:48,925
That's a pretty stupid
way of saying thank you.

333
00:20:54,820 --> 00:20:55,820
They're here!

334
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:57,977
There's no more time for a chit-chat!

335
00:20:58,060 --> 00:20:59,900
Time to start hauling some ass!

336
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,180
This way, comrades!

337
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:04,090
Found them!

338
00:21:04,173 --> 00:21:06,081
Don't let those pirates get away!

339
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:07,200
Shoot now!

340
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:16,220
Wait, I got just the thing, period!

341
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:21,440
Don't let up, fire, I will!

342
00:21:22,580 --> 00:21:24,360
Everybody follow me, alright?

343
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:28,780
We don't want to get
snapped up by Fujitora!

344
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:31,240
Stick together no matter what!

345
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:44,980
Huh? Mr. Luffy!

346
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,997
You guys can go on ahead.

347
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,537
I got something I need to do.

348
00:21:49,620 --> 00:21:50,450
What?

349
00:21:50,540 --> 00:21:52,337
We don't have a lot of time here, Luffy.

350
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,540
So whatever it is, make it quick.

351
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,711
We'll wait for you there.

352
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:58,760
Okay, see ya. Let's go.

353
00:21:59,180 --> 00:22:01,357
Actually, you're running to the south, Mr.

354
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:02,270
Zoro.

355
00:22:02,353 --> 00:22:05,660
But somehow you still
look whoops. What? Lucy?

356
00:22:06,340 --> 00:22:09,575
Yes, they're about to set
sail to escape from the Navy.

357
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:11,920
Oh no, they can't.

358
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:14,513
I haven't had a chance to say thank you.

359
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:23,860
Could today be the day
his luck finally runs out?

360
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,600
Fate's protected him from my hand.

361
00:22:31,580 --> 00:22:32,640
Until now.

362
00:22:36,460 --> 00:22:41,000
From this point on, instead of
Yisho, I'm commanding all units.

363
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:43,517
And I want you to keep tracking down the

364
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:45,617
criminals who were
hidden inside the palace,

365
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:46,530
got it?

366
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:51,513
What about Straw Hat's group who were
seen running from the hill in Karta?

367
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:53,800
Just follow the flag, everybody!

368
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:01,440
Are you okay, Mr. Sniper King?

369
00:23:02,220 --> 00:23:04,338
You're even cool when you fall down!

370
00:23:06,700 --> 00:23:10,217
Are you sure it's safe to run straight
through the town with Marines everywhere?

371
00:23:10,300 --> 00:23:11,560
Would I lie to you?

372
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:13,878
Just keep running and trust me, sir!

373
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:16,534
We're pursuing the pirates as we speak.

374
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:19,457
It looks like they're making
their way to the eastern port.

375
00:23:19,540 --> 00:23:20,380
Roger that.

376
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:22,605
Get that port on the line now.

377
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,270
Yes, hello.

378
00:23:24,353 --> 00:23:27,717
You've reached the Navy lookout unit
currently stationed at the eastern port.

379
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:28,630
Over.

380
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:32,480
Everything's good here. Over.

381
00:23:34,980 --> 00:23:36,457
Everything is good.

382
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:39,197
Would it kill you to
take this more seriously?

383
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:42,097
The pirates are headed
straight towards you right now.

384
00:23:42,180 --> 00:23:44,117
I don't think so.

385
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:45,737
It's all quiet on our end.

386
00:23:45,820 --> 00:23:49,257
Don't bother sending backup over.

387
00:23:49,340 --> 00:23:50,417
Oh yeah.

388
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:53,797
Give me your name and your marine code.

389
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,710
My what?

390
00:23:54,793 --> 00:24:00,100
Uh, let's see, damn it all!

391
00:24:00,780 --> 00:24:03,177
Oh, they've taken control
of the eastern port.

392
00:24:03,260 --> 00:24:06,040
Send in some reinforcements. Sir!

393
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:10,809
Head straight to the port.

394
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:13,240
We can cover for you. Thank you!

395
00:24:16,460 --> 00:24:19,048
Don't waste our time
on that thank you crap.

396
00:24:21,940 --> 00:24:23,400
We owe you guys.

397
00:24:23,700 --> 00:24:26,120
We'll be paying you back for a long time.

398
00:24:27,260 --> 00:24:28,780
Really, a rope block?

399
00:24:38,620 --> 00:24:39,450
All clear.

400
00:24:39,533 --> 00:24:40,615
Wow, you're the best!

401
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:55,537
We've located the criminals who were
supposed to be at the Royal Palace,

402
00:24:55,620 --> 00:24:58,057
but for some reason they're
all in the middle of town, sir!

403
00:24:58,140 --> 00:24:58,970
What?

404
00:24:59,053 --> 00:25:00,697
wait a second are you telling me that the

405
00:25:00,780 --> 00:25:05,960
palace is empty we're in
front of the I found us!

406
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:10,200
Straw Hat's here!

407
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:12,540
Gum-Gum!

408
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:16,400
Fireworks!

409
00:25:31,340 --> 00:25:32,170
Rebecca!

410
00:25:32,253 --> 00:25:33,083
Rebecca!

411
00:25:33,166 --> 00:25:35,520
Hey, tell me where you are!

412
00:25:39,600 --> 00:25:42,760
What is Straw Hat doing in
front of the royal palace?

413
00:25:44,560 --> 00:25:47,200
Do not let him get away! Right! Rebecca!

414
00:25:48,700 --> 00:25:49,530
Huh?

415
00:25:50,600 --> 00:25:52,920
Hey! Huh? Rebecca!

416
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:58,379
Somebody's calling for me, but why?

417
00:26:02,540 --> 00:26:03,737
Lucy? Lucy!

418
00:26:03,820 --> 00:26:05,040
I'm up here!

419
00:26:06,380 --> 00:26:07,210
Lucy!

420
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:10,110
No!

421
00:26:10,220 --> 00:26:11,677
Don't speak to him, my lady.

422
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:13,160
He's a filthy pirate.

423
00:26:13,700 --> 00:26:14,800
There you are!

424
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:18,060
Thank you. Good.

425
00:26:18,620 --> 00:26:22,900
I need you to summon Viola and
Rebecca for me, please. Yes, sir.

426
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:24,953
We'll address the town.

427
00:26:25,580 --> 00:26:29,637
And declare that my family and I
will be returning to the throne,

428
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:31,680
if that's what they want.

429
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:32,880
Gladly, sir.

430
00:26:33,180 --> 00:26:36,117
I've been looking forward
to this day for so long.

431
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:37,030
Rebecca!

432
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,260
Lucy, I'm here!

433
00:26:42,120 --> 00:26:43,240
Thank goodness!

434
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:45,840
Strata, what do you want?

435
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,685
Please get back, Lady Rebecca.

436
00:26:58,420 --> 00:26:59,620
What a relief!

437
00:26:59,980 --> 00:27:01,040
You're still here!

438
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:03,820
Listen, I wanted to say thank you for...

439
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:05,957
Shut up!

440
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:08,197
That's not the reason why I came!

441
00:27:08,280 --> 00:27:10,960
Are you okay with all of this? Huh?

442
00:27:12,460 --> 00:27:13,437
Soldier, I mean!

443
00:27:13,520 --> 00:27:15,100
He's gonna leave forever!

444
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:22,020
Well, the thing is, he sent me a letter.

445
00:27:27,660 --> 00:27:32,484
It sounds like he's trying to put as much
distance between him and me as possible.

446
00:27:37,740 --> 00:27:40,240
He wants us to be strangers from now on.

447
00:27:42,540 --> 00:27:43,580
Oh, shut up!

448
00:27:43,800 --> 00:27:45,800
Stop acting like you're my father!

449
00:27:48,700 --> 00:27:51,994
It must be because of the
terrible things I said to him.

450
00:27:55,080 --> 00:27:56,777
You can't beat the flamingo!

451
00:27:56,860 --> 00:27:58,160
Look at yourself!

452
00:27:58,400 --> 00:28:00,680
You're just a broken toy with one leg!

453
00:28:10,540 --> 00:28:13,760
Do you think he doesn't
want us to live together?

454
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,720
Maybe I'm just a nuisance.

455
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,160
Beats me, not my call!

456
00:28:23,460 --> 00:28:26,460
I just came to ask if you're
fine with him leaving!

457
00:28:26,860 --> 00:28:30,080
So tell me, cause I gotta
get out of this kingdom too!

458
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,400
Of course not!

459
00:28:33,840 --> 00:28:35,460
It's not okay at all!

460
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:37,960
Then come with me!

461
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:40,440
Let's go.

462
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:43,660
Lady Rebecca!

463
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:46,240
Hold on, Straw Hat, Rebecca!

464
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,310
Viola!

465
00:28:49,393 --> 00:28:50,780
I need a favor from you!

466
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:54,020
Taking off!

467
00:29:01,260 --> 00:29:03,900
Hey, don't let go! I'm trying!

468
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,160
There he is!

469
00:29:06,820 --> 00:29:07,840
Your Majesty!

470
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,800
What's the matter?

471
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,320
It's terrible.

472
00:29:11,580 --> 00:29:14,227
Lady Rebecca's been
carried away by a pirate!

473
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,440
A pirate?

474
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:17,560
What was his name?

475
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,677
Where did he come from?

476
00:29:18,760 --> 00:29:19,637
Tell me everything!

477
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,860
Was he a warrior from the Coliseum?

478
00:29:22,320 --> 00:29:23,597
Um, it...

479
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:24,937
It was...

480
00:29:25,020 --> 00:29:27,380
It was Straw Hat Luffy, sir!

481
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:32,553
A man just came to the palace
and kidnapped Lady Rebecca!

482
00:29:33,360 --> 00:29:36,900
I'm pretty sure it was Straw
Hat Luffy, right? I think so.

483
00:29:37,120 --> 00:29:39,826
He's probably taking her
for ransom, isn't he?

484
00:29:41,100 --> 00:29:42,480
But that can't be.

485
00:29:42,760 --> 00:29:46,060
Lucy, it doesn't sound like him at all.

486
00:29:46,860 --> 00:29:48,389
I'm sure there's a reason.

487
00:29:49,420 --> 00:29:50,660
Hey, Lucy!

488
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:53,360
I still love you!

489
00:29:55,020 --> 00:29:56,800
What are you saying? You see?

490
00:29:57,140 --> 00:30:00,677
This is what happens when you
trust pirates to do as they please.

491
00:30:00,760 --> 00:30:04,878
Now go capture Straw Hat and return
the princess to the palace safely.

492
00:30:14,940 --> 00:30:15,840
Up there!

493
00:30:16,300 --> 00:30:18,947
Special sniper unit,
take your shot, quickly!

494
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:37,657
Oh no, they collapsed out of nowhere!

495
00:30:37,740 --> 00:30:41,657
It knocked them down, conquerors Haki!

496
00:30:41,740 --> 00:30:45,917
No, looks like they're
still conscious regardless.

497
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:48,817
The pirates are about to escape!

498
00:30:48,900 --> 00:30:51,700
I want battle ships in place.

499
00:30:51,860 --> 00:30:54,840
Send all of our forces east to Korta, sir

500
00:30:58,680 --> 00:31:00,040
There he is

501
00:31:29,420 --> 00:31:30,500
What's going on?

502
00:31:31,280 --> 00:31:32,110
Lucy!

503
00:31:32,193 --> 00:31:34,140
That's my dinner! I'm sorry!

504
00:31:38,780 --> 00:31:39,610
Listen.

505
00:31:40,940 --> 00:31:42,977
I'm gonna drop you off at the hill.

506
00:31:43,060 --> 00:31:44,236
I'll lure them away.

507
00:31:44,760 --> 00:31:46,300
Can you run for it, okay?

508
00:31:46,540 --> 00:31:48,817
Seems like everybody's
on the lookout for you.

509
00:31:48,900 --> 00:31:52,135
If you get caught, they'll
take you back to the palace.

510
00:31:54,340 --> 00:31:55,520
Red, got it.

511
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,812
We better hurry, though.

512
00:31:57,940 --> 00:31:59,940
I don't know how long you'll stay.

513
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:03,500
Thank you for everything
you've done, Lucy.

514
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:06,840
No problem.

515
00:32:07,100 --> 00:32:08,218
Glad it worked out.

516
00:32:29,220 --> 00:32:30,937
My little girl.

517
00:32:31,020 --> 00:32:32,237
You're so cute.

518
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:34,640
Stop crying.

519
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,360
Scarlet.

520
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:48,857
I fulfilled my duty.

521
00:32:48,940 --> 00:32:52,340
Forgive me for cooking up
a lie about our marriage.

522
00:32:56,060 --> 00:32:58,997
I just want Rebecca to live a happy life.

523
00:32:59,080 --> 00:33:01,100
Safe from my past.

524
00:33:25,300 --> 00:33:27,712
You're going to learn to defend yourself.

525
00:33:27,940 --> 00:33:31,440
Mother said I shouldn't
hurt others no matter what.

526
00:33:31,780 --> 00:33:35,309
But you must protect yourself
from those who would hurt you.

527
00:33:37,940 --> 00:33:39,077
Stand up, child.

528
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,100
Don't give up.

529
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,937
Because you're a member
of the royal family,

530
00:33:44,020 --> 00:33:48,140
you've had to endure the hatred of
this nation for an entire decade.

531
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:51,300
But this time, it will be different.

532
00:33:52,100 --> 00:33:54,747
You can live the life
you were meant to lead,

533
00:33:55,140 --> 00:33:56,300
a peaceful one.

534
00:33:58,580 --> 00:34:01,345
But that's not a world
that I can be a part of.

535
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:08,470
Rebecca!

536
00:34:13,140 --> 00:34:15,480
How dare you lie to me?

537
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:20,960
Oh, the letter.

538
00:34:21,620 --> 00:34:22,920
I wasn't lying.

539
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,282
Look, I have a terrible history.

540
00:34:25,680 --> 00:34:29,600
I was a sorry excuse for a man
always getting into fights.

541
00:34:30,180 --> 00:34:31,800
And I was a killer, too.

542
00:34:33,100 --> 00:34:35,740
I can't deny what I've done.

543
00:34:36,500 --> 00:34:38,080
That's the honest truth.

544
00:34:42,040 --> 00:34:45,864
All right, but why did you say I
was the daughter of some prince?

545
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:48,580
That's such a hateful lie.

546
00:34:53,180 --> 00:34:56,217
It doesn't matter how many
people he may have killed,

547
00:34:56,300 --> 00:34:59,000
or how much his hands
are tainted in blood.

548
00:34:59,580 --> 00:35:01,520
I only have one father.

549
00:35:03,060 --> 00:35:06,320
I'm proud to say I'm
the daughter of Kiros.

550
00:35:15,680 --> 00:35:17,720
So you don't have to lie.

551
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:24,140
Happiness will return to you.

552
00:35:24,940 --> 00:35:27,600
Till then, I'll stay by your side.

553
00:35:35,700 --> 00:35:37,837
I want you to stay with me.

554
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:39,300
You promised, soldier.

555
00:35:47,200 --> 00:35:51,420
Even after all the things that I've done.

556
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:57,120
Let's live together.

557
00:35:59,080 --> 00:35:59,910
Okay, Dad.

558
00:36:13,480 --> 00:36:16,960
Sorry, father, but it seems
Rebecca won't be coming back.

559
00:36:17,540 --> 00:36:18,440
Very well.

560
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:20,120
I thought as much.

561
00:36:21,620 --> 00:36:22,450
I'm glad.

562
00:36:22,533 --> 00:36:23,900
She made her own decision.

563
00:36:24,740 --> 00:36:27,760
Viola, I'm sorry, but
please take my place.

564
00:36:31,700 --> 00:36:33,160
I'm sorry, Viola.

565
00:36:33,540 --> 00:36:34,860
Please take my place.

566
00:36:35,200 --> 00:36:36,435
You mean as princess?

567
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:41,155
I can't believe I've had to
grant such a request twice.

568
00:36:42,240 --> 00:36:45,260
Rebecca really is just
like her mother, isn't she?

569
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:47,155
Luffy isn't here yet?

570
00:36:47,660 --> 00:36:49,740
I haven't seen Law anywhere either.

571
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:53,337
They're the ones who are
supposed to be running this show.

572
00:36:53,420 --> 00:36:57,655
Our group is pretty tough, but what
if the Navy brings out the big guns?

573
00:36:59,520 --> 00:37:00,700
Here he comes.

574
00:37:06,780 --> 00:37:08,740
FUCHI Dorry!

575
00:37:09,260 --> 00:37:10,700
Idiot, we're dead.

576
00:37:12,420 --> 00:37:14,200
Hurry up, Mr. Luffy!

577
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:25,180
What now? Huh?

578
00:37:25,540 --> 00:37:26,880
Only one option.
